flowchart LR
  U[User / SSO + MFA\nauthn] --> WAF[WAF + TLS\nnetwork]
  WAF --> LB[ALB multi-AZ\nload_balancer]
  LB --> APP[App Fargate multi-AZ\ncompute]
  APP --> GW[HTTP API + LLM gateway\ngateway]
  APP --> DB[(Aurora PostgreSQL HA\ndatabase)]
  APP --> VEC[(pgvector\nvector_db)]
  APP --> CACHE[(ElastiCache + SQS\ncache_queue)]
  APP --> S3[(S3 per-user workspace\nobject_storage)]
  APP --> SEC[Secrets Manager + KMS\nsecrets_kms]
  APP --> CON[OAuth connectors\nconnectors]
  GW --> BR[Bedrock Nova routing\nllm + embedding]
  APP --> SB[ECS Fargate sandbox\nno egress, 30s TTL\nsandbox]
  APP --> GOV[Guardrail + DLP + audit\ngovernance]
  APP --> MON[CloudWatch logs/metrics\nmonitoring]
  DB --> BAK[S3 backup + DR\nbackup_dr]
  APP --> CICD[CodePipeline + ECR + IaC\ncicd]
  CON -->|ACL filter| VEC
  SB -->|result| APP
  BR -->|stream tokens| GW
